From 63c47dcb56f03a2b7f04eccb963211566752cd20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:22:53 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 20/24] inkling2: drop Mini's prompt GEMM rounding kernels,
 which no path runs now

Since Mini's prompt rows keep the decode kernels, tf_ink2_loop_rotate and
tf_ink2_loop_tail serve nothing: the prompt GEMM is Small's alone and runs
its released rounding. The two kernels, their records and the Rounding
choice go; prompt_dense takes Small's epilogue again.
---
